# Identification for this repository

Assume **non-experimental, ecological, territory-month** data unless a file is labelled otherwise.

**Licensed estimand.** Separate negative-binomial models of monthly first-hospitalisation counts (CHD, HF) among people with T2D and/or HTN, Hong Kong, January 2013–December 2023 (132 months), with calendar-month factors, a 4-df time-trend spline, and a days-in-month offset. Report count ratios. Official hot nights / very hot days / cold days are interpreted **per five additional days in a month** (`I(count/5)`). That is a linear reporting scale, not a consecutive-day trigger.

**Uncertainty.** Always display the ladder: model-based, HC1, Newey–West lag-3, Newey–West lag-6. Clustered “state/hospital/market” SEs are the wrong analogy. Do not choose an SE method because its interval excludes 1.

**What this is not.** Cohort incidence, principal-diagnosis CHD/HF, AMI, individual causality, daily DLNM, mortality attributable fraction, excess-death model, or a staggered policy DiD. Stroke remains undelivered. Admission cause is absent.

**Gate 3.** Open. Confirmatory freeze is false while all twelve Model 1 *q* > 0.19. Only Hogan, Roro, Bishai, and Bob can freeze. Agents may write a team request, never a freeze.

**Hogan weather.** The live HKO paragraph (`HOGAN_OPEN` / `HOGAN_AVG`) is verbatim. Do not rewrite averaging, stations, or definitions.

**Provenance labels.** `REAL`, `SYNTHETIC`, `HA_APPROVED_AGGREGATE`. Never invent HA row counts, ICD lists, IRB numbers, or Model 2/3 health coefficients when panels are absent.

**Generic US health-econ defaults are out of scope for the journal track.** Do not reach for TWFE, Callaway & Sant'Anna, Sun & Abraham, did2s, synthdid, Medicaid expansion DiD, or QALY/CEA simulations when editing `manuscript/live_collaborative/`, `manuscript/covid_period/`, or Stage 3. Those tools belong only in Playbook 08 (Explore, synthetic).

**10 Sep 2026 angle (Hogan proposed, not frozen).** Candidate journal headline is pre- vs post-COVID window dependence. Thermal live pack is parked at `manuscript/archive/thermal_extremes_2026-08/`. Do not rewrite `live_collaborative/` in place. Do not write “health improved.” Labs were never in the HA monthly transfer.

**Code defaults when writing estimators for this extract.** R (`MASS::glm.nb`, `splines`, project helpers in `scripts/final_model_helpers.R`), not `fixest` TWFE. Tables already export CSV for the Hogan builder (`scripts/64_hogan_20260824_manuscript_docx.py`) and Laidlaw Quarto/R path.
